","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/40372435?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjszaniszlo","html_url":"https://github.com/jjszaniszlo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjszaniszlo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjszaniszlo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjszaniszlo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjszaniszlo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjszaniszlo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjszaniszlo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjszaniszlo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjszaniszlo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjszaniszlo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-02T20:17:29Z","updated_at":"2025-08-02T20:20:00Z","body":"I was able to reproduce it in 4.3.stable.mono, which i believe is also when being able to expand the vector output types was introduced?\n\nVisualShaderNodeCustom::get_output_port_type already has a fallback case of returning a scalar type, but also produces an error message when doing so.  No other node that i can see does this.  In my testing I don't see any way a user can force the visual shader editor to connect output connections on a output port that don't exist.  And so I think making it fallback to a scalar type, similar to other nodes, without a message will fix this issue.\n\nAnother possible fix is to fix the assumption of the callers of VisualShaderNode::get_output_port_type that it's not expanded.  Fallback to scalar before its called basically, because expanded ports aren't stored as an output port and are handled differently.  I think this is a lot less reasonable of a fix right now because every other node already falls back to scalar anyways.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3146704812/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]